  "verifies": {
    "G078-C1": "the DTO class action configures the Bean Validation constraints of the DTO fields in its prompts: the constraints copied from the entity are listed per field, constraints can be added from scratch (NotNull, NotBlank, Email on fitting String/object fields) and the result carries exactly the configured set. The original's wizard table (per-field rows with checkboxes) is not reproduced; only the prompt flow is checked, and only the constraints NotNull, NotBlank, Size, Min, Max, Pattern and Email with literal arguments are involved.",
    "G078-C3": "each constraint can be enabled or disabled (the @Email copied from the entity is left out) and its message customized (@NotBlank gets message = Name is required, the added @NotBlank on email gets Email is required, @Size keeps its arguments without a message)."
  },
